  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-002","slug":"chiba-futtsu-anishita","phrase":"あにした","reading":"あにした","standardJapanese":"何をした・どうした","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「あにした」は、相手や物事について「何をした」「どうした」と尋ねる表現です。資料では車について問い掛ける短い使用例が示されています。故障、処分、移動のどれを尋ねた場面か、語調や現在の使用頻度は資料から断定しません。","exampleDialect":"車、あにした。","exampleStandard":"車、どうした。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["車について尋ねる場面","状態や行方を確認する会話"],"emotionTags":["疑問"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で「あにした」、意味「何した」、使用例「車、あにした」を確認。併記形「あじょした」は別見出しにせず関連形として扱う。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-003","slug":"chiba-futtsu-acchin-ho","phrase":"あっちんほー","reading":"あっちんほー","standardJapanese":"あちらの方","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「あっちんほー」は、話し手から離れた「あちらの方」を指す表現です。資料では、誰かがあちらの方向へ行ったと伝える使用例が示されています。距離の程度、方角の限定、人物以外を指す用法、現在の使用頻度は確認できません。","exampleDialect":"あっちんほーへ行ったよ。","exampleStandard":"あちらの方へ行ったよ。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["移動先を伝える場面","離れた方向を指す会話"],"emotionTags":[],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で語形、意味「あちらの方」、使用例を確認。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-004","slug":"chiba-futtsu-oinee","phrase":"おいねえ","reading":"おいねえ","standardJapanese":"しょうがない・良くない","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「おいねえ」は、「しょうがない」「良くない」に当たる表現です。資料では、出来が悪いため仕方がないと評価する使用例が示されています。単なる品質評価と諦めの気持ちのどちらが中心か、併記形「おいない」との差は未確認です。","exampleDialect":"出来がわりーで、おいねえよう。","exampleStandard":"出来が悪くて、しょうがないよ。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["出来を評価する場面","仕方がないと述べる会話"],"emotionTags":["諦め"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で「おいねえ／おいない」、意味「しょうがない／良くない」と使用例を確認。記事は例文に現れる形を見出しにした。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-005","slug":"chiba-futtsu-odasu","phrase":"おだす","reading":"おだす","standardJapanese":"叱る","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「おだす」は、人を「叱る」ことを表します。資料では、言うことを聞かない子どもを叱るという使用例が示されています。注意、説教、強い叱責のどこまで含むか、活用形、相手との関係、現在の使用頻度は資料から判断できません。","exampleDialect":"言うことを聞かない子をおだす。","exampleStandard":"言うことを聞かない子を叱る。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["子どもを叱る場面","言うことを聞かない行動への注意"],"emotionTags":["叱責"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で語形、意味「叱る」、子どもを叱る使用例を確認。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-006","slug":"chiba-futtsu-oraga","phrase":"おらが","reading":"おらが","standardJapanese":"自分の家","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「おらが」は、「自分の家」を指す表現です。資料では、相手を自宅へ来るよう誘う使用例が示されています。一人称の所有を広く表す形なのか、家を指すまとまりとして使うのか、話者属性や現在の使用頻度は確認できません。","exampleDialect":"おらがへ来なよお。","exampleStandard":"自分の家へ来なよ。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["自宅へ招く場面","訪問を勧める会話"],"emotionTags":["歓迎"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で語形、意味「自分の家」、自宅へ誘う使用例を確認。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-007","slug":"chiba-futtsu-kandachi","phrase":"かんだち","reading":"かんだち","standardJapanese":"雷","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「かんだち」は、気象現象の「雷」を指す地域語です。資料では、今夜は雷になりそうだと告げる短い使用例が示されています。雷鳴と落雷のどちらを中心に指すか、天候予測以外の用法、現在の使用頻度は資料から断定できません。","exampleDialect":"今夜、かんだちだぞ。","exampleStandard":"今夜、雷だぞ。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["今夜の天候を告げる場面","雷への注意"],"emotionTags":["注意"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で語形、意味「雷」、今夜の天候を述べる使用例を確認。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-008","slug":"chiba-futtsu-kumu","phrase":"くむ","reading":"くむ","standardJapanese":"崩れる","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「くむ」は、道などが「崩れる」ことを表します。資料では「道がくむ」という短い使用例が示され、別項目の「びゃく」でも土手が崩れる用例に現れます。崩壊の規模、自然に崩れる場合以外の用法、現在の使用頻度は未確認です。","exampleDialect":"道がくむ。","exampleStandard":"道が崩れる。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["道の崩れを述べる場面","地形の変化への注意"],"emotionTags":["注意"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で語形、意味「崩れる」、道が崩れる使用例を確認。土手を指す「びゃく」の例にも同形が現れる。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-009","slug":"chiba-futtsu-kunna","phrase":"くんな","reading":"くんな","standardJapanese":"ください","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「くんな」は、相手に物を求める「ください」に当たる表現です。資料では、目の前の物を「これ」と指して求める短い使用例が示されています。丁寧さ、命令との違い、動詞に続く用法、相手との関係や現在の使用頻度は未確認です。","exampleDialect":"これ、くんな。","exampleStandard":"これ、ください。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["物を求める場面","相手への依頼"],"emotionTags":["依頼"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で語形、意味「ください」、物を指して求める使用例を確認。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-010","slug":"chiba-futtsu-keeru","phrase":"けえる","reading":"けえる","standardJapanese":"帰る","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「けえる」は、いた場所から「帰る」ことを表します。資料では、帰る時間になったと告げる使用例が示されています。人が自宅へ戻る場合以外にも使えるか、母音の発音、活用形、話者世代、現在の使用頻度は資料から確認できません。","exampleDialect":"けえる時間だ。","exampleStandard":"帰る時間だ。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["帰宅時間を告げる場面","行動の区切り"],"emotionTags":[],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で語形、意味「帰る」、帰る時間を述べる使用例を確認。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-011","slug":"chiba-futtsu-kenbe","phrase":"けんべ","reading":"けんべ","standardJapanese":"帰ろう","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「けんべ」は、相手と一緒に帰ることを提案する「帰ろう」に当たります。資料では「そろそろ」と組み合わせ、帰る時機を促す使用例が示されています。一人での意志表明にも使うか、語調、活用体系、現在の使用頻度は未確認です。","exampleDialect":"そろそろけえんべよ。","exampleStandard":"そろそろ帰ろうよ。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["帰宅を提案する場面","行動を共にする相手への誘い"],"emotionTags":["誘い"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で見出し「けんべ」、意味「帰ろう」、使用例「そろそろけえんべよ」を確認。見出しと例文の表記差はそのまま保持する。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-012","slug":"chiba-futtsu-kowai","phrase":"こわい","reading":"こわい","standardJapanese":"疲れた","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「こわい」は、恐怖ではなく身体的に「疲れた」状態を表します。資料では、疲労を短く訴える使用例が示されています。共通語の「怖い」と同形のため、富津という地域情報と前後の文脈が必要です。疲労の程度や現在の頻度は未確認です。","exampleDialect":"おお、こわー。","exampleStandard":"ああ、疲れた。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["疲労を訴える場面","作業後などの感嘆"],"emotionTags":["疲労"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で語形、意味「疲れた」、疲労を表す使用例を確認。共通語の恐怖の意味とは区別する。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-013","slug":"chiba-futtsu-kooranmashi","phrase":"こーらんまし","reading":"こーらんまし","standardJapanese":"この辺","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「こーらんまし」は、話し手に近い範囲の「この辺」を指します。資料では、この辺で何かを見たかと相手に尋ねる使用例が示されています。範囲の広さ、併記形「こーら」との差、場所を尋ねる以外の用法、現在の使用頻度は未確認です。","exampleDialect":"こーらんましで見たかえ。","exampleStandard":"この辺で見たかい。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["目撃場所を尋ねる場面","近くの範囲を指す会話"],"emotionTags":["疑問"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で「こーらんまし／こーら」、意味「この辺」、目撃を尋ねる使用例を確認。記事は例文に現れる形を見出しにした。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-014","slug":"chiba-futtsu-sotta","phrase":"そった","reading":"そった","standardJapanese":"言った","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「そった」は、「言った」に当たる過去の発話表現です。資料では、昨日すでに言ったことを相手へ伝える短い使用例が示されています。「そう言った」の縮約か別の活用形か、主語や引用との接続、現在の使用頻度は資料から判断できません。","exampleDialect":"昨日、そったよお。","exampleStandard":"昨日、言ったよ。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["以前の発言を確認する場面","昨日伝えたことを述べる会話"],"emotionTags":["確認"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で語形、意味「言った」、昨日の発言を述べる使用例を確認。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-015","slug":"chiba-futtsu-teppatsu","phrase":"てっぱつ","reading":"てっぱつ","standardJapanese":"でかい・大きい","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「てっぱつ」は、物が「でかい」「大きい」ことを表します。資料では、目の前の貝の大きさに反応する使用例が示されています。驚きを必ず伴うか、人や数量にも使えるか、程度の強さ、現在の使用頻度は資料から確認できません。","exampleDialect":"この貝てっぱつだな。","exampleStandard":"この貝は大きいな。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["貝の大きさを評価する場面","目の前の物への感想"],"emotionTags":["驚き"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で語形、意味「でかい／大きい」、貝の大きさを述べる使用例を確認。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
  {"id":"jp-12-chiba-016","slug":"chiba-futtsu-tebateba","phrase":"てばてば","reading":"てばてば","standardJapanese":"早く","description":"富津市公式の方言表にある「てばてば」は、行動を「早く」するよう促す表現です。資料では、相手と何かを早くやろうと呼び掛ける使用例が示されています。動作の速さと開始の早さのどちらを表すか、催促の強さ、現在の使用頻度は資料から断定できません。","exampleDialect":"てばてばやんべさ。","exampleStandard":"早くやろうよ。","prefectureCode":12,"prefectureName":"千葉県","regionName":"富津","municipality":"富津市","ageGroups":["unknown"],"usageContexts":["行動を急ぐよう促す場面","共同作業への呼び掛け"],"emotionTags":["催促"],"usageFrequency":"unknown","verificationStatus":"reference_confirmed","sourceType":"official_reference","sourceNote":"富津市公式ページの表で語形、意味「早く」、早くやろうと促す使用例を確認。","sourceTitle":"ふっつの方言","sourceOrganization":"富津市","sourceUrl":"https://www.city.futtsu.lg.jp/0000000795.html","sourceCheckedAt":"2026-09-01","evidenceScopes":["phrase","reading","meaning","region","example","usage"],"confidence":"high","recordingYear":null,"audioUrl":null,"videoUrl":null,"needsAudio":true,"audioPriority":1,"languageVariety":"japanese_dialect"},
